Modes:
  no path supplied       run the complete regression suite
  unittest selector      run one or more selected tests
  path / --inspect       read-only smoke inspection

Test options:
  -q, --quiet            quiet test output
  -v, --verbose          increase test verbosity
  -k PATTERN             run tests whose full id contains PATTERN

Smoke options are shown by:
  python test_lora_tools.py --inspect --help

